when user first visits with no games started they are shown the match configuration screen and then add a computer
player, then in the console logs we see these socket events logged

setPlayerList
playerConnected
setPlayer
gameOwnerUpdated
expansionList
matchConfigurationUpdated
playerConnected

if the user presses the ready button and we go to the game screen we then see
these socket events

setPlayerList
patchUpdate
setCardLibrary
setTokenDefinitions
matchReady
matchStarted
patchUpdate
addLogEntry

we see varying number of patchUpdate/addLogEntry depending if the computer or human player goes first.

and then the game is ready to be started by the first player.

upon refresh after that while in the game we see this list of events

setPlayerList
playerConnected
setPlayer
gameOwnerUpdated
patchUpdate
setCardLibrary
setTokenDefinitions
matchReady
matchStarted
